The sidebar of History Tracers is organized into sections. Each one groups content around a common theme.

The Main section contains the general pages. Home introduces the project. Acknowledgement recognizes contributors. Contact explains how to reach the team. Licence describes the terms. Version shows the history of changes. Gallery displays the images. Documentation teaches how to use the site.

The Sciences section introduces scientific thinking: The Knowledge, Scientific Method, Sources, and Philosophy.

Other science sections cover specialized topics. First Steps introduces mathematics. Universe explores Physics. The Origin of Matter examines how matter emerged. Atlas collects historical maps. The Origin of Life investigates life on Earth. Understanding Texts develops reading skills.

The History section explores cultures and civilizations. Genealogy traces family histories. Indigenous presents the timeline of indigenous peoples.

The Games section offers interactive math games.

Explore the sections and discover what interests you most.
